      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n.deki-reviews{\n  background:#f7e8df;\n  padding:80px 20px;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__inner{\n  max-width:1180px;\n  margin:0 auto;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__top{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:260px 1fr;\n  gap:50px;\n  align-items:center;\n  margin-bottom:38px;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__score{\n  text-align:center;\n  padding-right:35px;\n  border-right:1px solid #d9c2b8;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__number{\n  font-size:64px;\n  font-weight:750;\n  line-height:1;\n  color:#2f2229;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__stars{\n  color:#c84e73;\n  font-size:24px;\n  letter-spacing:3px;\n  margin:12px 0 8px;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__count{\n  color:#6d6266;\n  font-size:14px;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__bars{\n  display:grid;\n  gap:12px;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__bar{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:42px 1fr 44px;\n  gap:12px;\n  align-items:center;\n  color:#675c61;\n  font-size:14px;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__track{\n  height:8px;\n  background:#dfcec6;\n  border-radius:999px;\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__fill{\n  height:100%;\n  background:#7a294b;\n  border-radius:999px;\n}\n\n.deki-reviews__grid{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);\n  gap:18px;\n}\n\n.deki-review{\n  background:#fff;\n  border:1px solid #eadbd5;\n  border-radius:16px;\n  padding:24px;\n}\n\n.deki-review__stars{\n  color:#c84e73;\n  letter-spacing:2px;\n  font-size:18px;\n  margin-bottom:16px;\n}\n\n.deki-review__text{\n  color:#62575c;\n  line-height:1.6;\n  font-size:15px;\n  margin:0 0 20px;\n}\n\n.deki-review__name{\n  color:#302329;\n  font-weight:700;\n  font-size:14px;\n}\n\n.deki-review__verified{\n  display:inline-block;\n  margin-top:8px;\n  padding:4px 9px;\n  border-radius:999px;\n  background:#e8f4eb;\n  color:#467b55;\n  font-size:11px;\n  font-weight:700;\n}\n\n@media(max-width:768px){\n  .deki-reviews{\n    padding:56px 16px;\n  }\n\n  .deki-reviews__top{\n    grid-template-columns:1fr;\n    gap:28px;\n  }\n\n  .deki-reviews__score{\n    border-right:none;\n    border-bottom:1px solid #d9c2b8;\n    padding:0 0 28px;\n  }\n\n  .deki-reviews__grid{\n    grid-template-columns:1fr;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"deki-reviews\">\n  <div class=\"deki-reviews__inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"deki-reviews__top\">\n\n      <div class=\"deki-reviews__score\">\n        <div class=\"deki-reviews__number\">4,6</div>\n        <div class=\"deki-reviews__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <div class=\"deki-reviews__count\">Gebaseerd op klantbeoordelingen</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"deki-reviews__bars\">\n\n        <div class=\"deki-reviews__bar\">\n          <span>5★</span>\n          <div class=\"deki-reviews__track\">\n            <div class=\"deki-reviews__fill\" style=\"width:82%\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <span>82%</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"deki-reviews__bar\">\n          <span>4★</span>\n          <div class=\"deki-reviews__track\">\n            <div class=\"deki-reviews__fill\" style=\"width:12%\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <span>12%</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"deki-reviews__bar\">\n          <span>3★</span>\n          <div class=\"deki-reviews__track\">\n            <div class=\"deki-reviews__fill\" style=\"width:4%\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <span>4%</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"deki-reviews__bar\">\n          <span>2★</span>\n          <div class=\"deki-reviews__track\">\n            <div class=\"deki-reviews__fill\" style=\"width:1%\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <span>1%</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"deki-reviews__bar\">\n          <span>1★</span>\n          <div class=\"deki-reviews__track\">\n            <div class=\"deki-reviews__fill\" style=\"width:1%\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <span>1%</span>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"deki-reviews__grid\">\n\n      <article class=\"deki-review\">\n        <div class=\"deki-review__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"deki-review__text\">\n          Na enkele weken merkte ik duidelijk minder zichtbare haargroei. Het apparaat is eenvoudig in gebruik en voelt comfortabel aan.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"deki-review__name\">Sanne, Utrecht</div>\n        <span class=\"deki-review__verified\">Geverifieerde aankoop</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"deki-review\">\n        <div class=\"deki-review__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"deki-review__text\">\n          Vooral voor mijn benen en oksels werkt het erg prettig. De glijmodus maakt de behandeling snel en gemakkelijk.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"deki-review__name\">Demi, Rotterdam</div>\n        <span class=\"deki-review__verified\">Geverifieerde aankoop</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"deki-review\">\n        <div class=\"deki-review__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"deki-review__text\">\n          Mooie complete set en duidelijke instructies. Ik hoef veel minder vaak te scheren dan voorheen.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"deki-review__name\">Lana, Antwerpen</div>\n        <span class=\"deki-review__verified\">Geverifieerde aankoop</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"deki-review\">\n        <div class=\"deki-review__stars\">★★★★☆</div>\n        <p class=\"deki-review__text\">\n          U moet even geduld hebben, maar bij regelmatig gebruik zag ik na enkele weken verschil.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"deki-review__name\">Yara, Eindhoven</div>\n        <span class=\"deki-review__verified\">Geverifieerde aankoop</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"deki-review\">\n        <div class=\"deki-review__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"deki-review__text\">\n          Het apparaat ligt prettig in de hand en de verschillende standen zijn handig voor gevoelige zones.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"deki-review__name\">Kim, Groningen</div>\n        <span class=\"deki-review__verified\">Geverifieerde aankoop</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"deki-review\">\n        <div class=\"deki-review__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"deki-review__text\">\n          Zeer eenvoudig te gebruiken en netjes verpakt. De huid blijft langer glad dan met alleen scheren.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"deki-review__name\">Britt, Tilburg</div>\n        <span class=\"deki-review__verified\">Geverifieerde aankoop</span>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
